OL,3,GNEWSANightly #1.30 tourism tax plan
OL,4,Afaces axe after strong opposition
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors on Anglesey look set to
OL,7,Freject bringing in a tourist tax for
OL,8,Fthe island, following opposition to the
OL,9,Fproposals.
OL,11,FIt comes after Cyngor Gwynedd delayed
OL,12,Fits decision on imposing the tax, after
OL,13,Fa public consultation prompted
OL,14,Fthousands of responses from visitors,
OL,15,Fresidents and businesses.
OL,17,FIt was estimated the tax could raise
OL,18,Fupwards of #1.2 to #1.5m per year for
OL,19,FAnglesey, excluding VAT and after Welsh
OL,20,Fgovernment administration costs. But
OL,21,Fvisitors and those working in the
OL,22,Ftourism sector remain against it.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
