OL,3,GNEWSANightly #1.30 tourism tax plan
OL,4,Afaces axe after strong opposition
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnglesey council's executive agreed to
OL,7,Fthe recommendation of not imposing the
OL,8,FVisitor Levy during a meeting on
OL,9,FTuesday. A final decision will be made
OL,10,Fby the council on Thursday.
